WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.631
[g@Wukong and Bajie looked all around.

2
00:00:03.632 --> 00:00:06.392
But the Tang Monk was gone.@g]

3
00:00:06.393 --> 00:00:11.916
"That tiger ate our master," said Bajie. He shrugged.

4
00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:18.283
"I guess we don't have to protect him anymore. Good-bye, Wukong!"

5
00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:21.072
[g@The pig started to walk away.

6
00:00:21.073 --> 00:00:23.339
But Wukong grabbed him.@g]

7
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.187
[g@"You're not leaving!" said the monkey.

8
00:00:26.188 --> 00:00:28.598
"We have to save our master.@g]

9
00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:33.486
That tiger said he works for a demon, the great king Yellow Wind.

10
00:00:33.487 --> 00:00:39.047
The king's cave must be nearby."

11
00:00:39.048 --> 00:00:42.350
The tiger entered his master's cave.

12
00:00:42.351 --> 00:00:46.928
The Tang Monk was slumped over the tiger's shoulder.

13
00:00:46.929 --> 00:00:51.731
The great king Yellow Wind was sitting on his throne.

14
00:00:51.732 --> 00:00:57.963
"Great king!" cried the tiger. "I found the Tang Monk!"

15
00:00:57.964 --> 00:01:01.538
The demon king looked surprised and happy.

16
00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:06.250
"I have heard that anyone who eats the Tang Monk will live forever.

17
00:01:06.251 --> 00:01:08.993
Was the monk alone?"

18
00:01:08.994 --> 00:01:12.542
"He had two companions," said the tiger.

19
00:01:12.543 --> 00:01:14.059
[g@"One is a pig.

20
00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.930
The other is a monkey."@g]

21
00:01:16.931 --> 00:01:21.539
Yellow Wind trembled. "A monkey?" he said.

22
00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:27.809
"He must be Sun Wukong—the monkey who caused all that trouble in Heaven!"

23
00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:33.027
"Maybe," said the tiger. "But don't worry.

24
00:01:33.028 --> 00:01:36.822
[g@I distracted them with a fake tiger skin.

25
00:01:36.823 --> 00:01:40.024
They'll never find us."@g]

26
00:01:40.025 --> 00:01:44.196
The tiger patted his stomach and looked at the Tang Monk.

27
00:01:44.197 --> 00:01:49.442
"I'll tell the other demons to start a fire and prepare some spices."

28
00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:52.871
[g@Yellow Wind held up his hand.

29
00:01:52.872 --> 00:01:55.591
"Sun Wukong is powerful.@g]

30
00:01:55.592 --> 00:01:59.808
He and that pig might come looking for the monk.

31
00:01:59.809 --> 00:02:03.389
They'll be angry if they find out we ate him.

32
00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.850
Let's wait until they leave the area.

33
00:02:06.851 --> 00:02:10.765
Then we'll be able to enjoy our meal."

34
00:02:10.766 --> 00:02:16.631
[g@A small demon ran into the throne room.

35
00:02:16.632 --> 00:02:19.960
"Great king!" cried the demon.@g]

36
00:02:19.961 --> 00:02:24.777
"There are two strangers outside—a monkey and a pig.

37
00:02:24.778 --> 00:02:27.403
They said to hand over the Tang Monk.

38
00:02:27.404 --> 00:02:32.468
If we don't, they'll destroy our entire mountain!"

39
00:02:32.469 --> 00:02:38.218
"Oh no," moaned Yellow Wind. "This is bad!"

40
00:02:38.219 --> 00:02:41.258
[g@"Don't worry, King," said the tiger.

41
00:02:41.259 --> 00:02:44.629
"I will get rid of them."@g]

42
00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.801
[g@The tiger walked out of the throne room.

43
00:02:47.802 --> 00:02:53.865
The small demon followed him.@g]

44
00:02:53.866 --> 00:02:59.659
Outside the cave there was some yelling and then a crashing sound.

45
00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:04.002
A moment later the small demon ran back in.

46
00:03:04.003 --> 00:03:07.345
"Great king, disaster!" he cried.

47
00:03:07.346 --> 00:03:09.547
[g@"The tiger is dead!

48
00:03:09.548 --> 00:03:12.553
The pig killed him with his rake!"@g]

49
00:03:12.554 --> 00:03:15.338
[g@"What?" cried Yellow Wind.

50
00:03:15.339 --> 00:03:20.837
He stood up and grabbed a trident.@g]

51
00:03:20.838 --> 00:03:25.839
[g@He puffed out his chest and stomped out of the cave.

52
00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.109
He saw Wukong.@g]

53
00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:34.185
"So you're the monkey who caused all the trouble in Heaven," said Yellow Wind.

54
00:03:34.186 --> 00:03:38.011
"Hand over the Tang Monk!" demanded Wukong.

55
00:03:38.012 --> 00:03:43.360
"I didn't know you were so small," said Yellow Wind.

56
00:03:43.361 --> 00:03:45.805
[g@"Hit me on the head," said the monkey.

57
00:03:45.806 --> 00:03:47.666
"I'll grow bigger."@g]

58
00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:50.110
The demon king hesitated.

59
00:03:50.111 --> 00:03:53.459
"Go ahead!" said Wukong.

60
00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:57.130
[g@Yellow Wind knocked the monkey on the head.

61
00:03:57.131 --> 00:04:00.171
Instantly Wukong grew tall.@g]

62
00:04:00.172 --> 00:04:03.693
[g@"Now I'll hit you!" cried Wukong.

63
00:04:03.694 --> 00:04:07.094
He swung his iron bar.@g]

64
00:04:07.095 --> 00:04:11.529
[i@Crash!@i] The demon king blocked the bar with his trident.

65
00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:17.314
[i@Clang!@i] The two fought up and down the side of the mountain.

66
00:04:17.315 --> 00:04:20.070
"I'll use some magic," thought the monkey.

67
00:04:20.071 --> 00:04:24.960
He grabbed a handful of hair and blew on it.

68
00:04:24.961 --> 00:04:29.400
Dozens of little Wukongs ran toward the demon king.

69
00:04:29.401 --> 00:04:35.653
Yellow Wind laughed. "I know a magic trick too!"

70
00:04:35.654 --> 00:04:43.936
He looked down and blew three times.

71
00:04:43.937 --> 00:04:46.191
[g@The sky grew dark.

72
00:04:46.192 --> 00:04:50.202
A powerful yellow wind whipped across the mountain.@g]

73
00:04:50.203 --> 00:04:53.583
Trees snapped and rocks tumbled.

74
00:04:53.584 --> 00:04:58.768
Wukong, Bajie, and all the little Wukongs tumbled down the mountain.

75
00:04:58.769 --> 00:05:07.750
They landed at the bottom in a cloud of dust.

76
00:05:07.751 --> 00:05:17.697
The demon king went back into his cave and slammed the door shut.

